    "reconstruction_notes": {
      "en": "Original living whole-organism teaching interpretation: low plated body, organically embedded slender curved tube feet with primary/secondary gaps and restrained articulated surface rhythm. Colors, nominal0.07m span, simplified repeated plates and static pose are art choices. No exact microscopic plate or podium counts, internal water-vascular reconstruction, feeding/movement mechanism or named specimen replica claimed. Blunt flexible-looking tips and curved paths distinguish podia from rigid random spines.",
      "zh": "原创全体教学生活复原：低矮板甲体、自然嵌接的细长弯曲管足、主次间隙与克制的分节表面节奏。颜色、0.07米名义跨度、重复板片简化及静态姿态为美术设定。不主张精确微板或管足数、内部水管系统、摄食/运动机制或具名标本复制。钝柔足端及弯曲走向区别于随机刚刺。"
    },
